    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.15em;margin-bottom:10px;\">Ferry to Shetland Islands</div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\">&bull;&nbsp; Name of ferry company:</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\"><input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"1\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> Ferries</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\">&bull;&nbsp; Ferries depart seven times per</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\"><input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"2\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> in summer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\">&bull;&nbsp; Cost for four people with car:</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\">a little less than &pound;<input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"3\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\">&bull;&nbsp; Cancellation policy:</td><td style=\"padding:4px 8px;vertical-align:top;\">receive a <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"4\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"><br>(if cancelled a month in advance)</td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:1.1em;margin:12px 0 6px;\">Advice</div><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Cabins:</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; book one with a <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"5\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; luxury cabins have a TV</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Bring snacks and <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> for the children</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; A <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> is required for the dog kennels</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Try to see <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> in the morning</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; If time, visit <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> Castle</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> restaurant in a nearby village is recommended</p></div></div>",
